WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.317 --> 00:00:01.087
Aaj is dharti pe

2
00:00:01.107 --> 00:00:02.545
saat hazaar languages hain.

3
00:00:02.565 --> 00:00:04.053
Duniya ki bahut si

4
00:00:04.073 --> 00:00:05.842
languages endangered hain. Aur

5
00:00:05.862 --> 00:00:08.039
kuch estimates ke mutabik...

6
00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:09.151
lagbhag har do hafte

7
00:00:09.171 --> 00:00:10.386
mein ek language disappear

8
00:00:10.649 --> 00:00:11.445
ho jaati hai! Ye

9
00:00:11.465 --> 00:00:13.579
ek estimate hai... exact

10
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:15.526
number pe debate hai...

11
00:00:15.546 --> 00:00:17.225
lekin trend saaf hai.

12
00:00:17.245 --> 00:00:18.826
Languages tezi se marr

13
00:00:18.846 --> 00:00:19.963
rahi hain. Ek language

14
00:00:19.983 --> 00:00:22.197
marti hai. Uska aakhri

15
00:00:22.217 --> 00:00:23.809
speaker mar jaata hai.

16
00:00:23.829 --> 00:00:24.962
Aur uske saath... sirf

17
00:00:24.982 --> 00:00:26.934
shabd nahi jaate. Ek

18
00:00:26.954 --> 00:00:28.403
poori worldview jaati hai.

19
00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.790
Ek soch ka tareeka

20
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:30.758
jaata hai jo kabhi

21
00:00:31.188 --> 00:00:33.030
wapas nahi aayega!

